{
 "version": 1,
 "_doc": [
  "Declarative posting rules (DECISIONS B12). Interpreted by posting.php (PHP) and tests/oracle.py (Python) - keep both in sync.",
  "rule: {id, doc_type, when?: expr, lines: [line]}.  All matching rules of one doc_type contribute lines to ONE voucher (source_type=doc_type, source_id=doc id).",
  "line: {account: <role from pb_acc_roles()>, debit?: expr, credit?: expr, tafsili?: <dim key>, cost_center?: <dim key>, desc?: text, when?: expr}.  Zero lines are dropped.",
  "expr: integer | \"@field\" (document field, integer rial/qty, missing=0) | {op, args:[expr..]}.",
  "ops: add sub mul max min pos(x)=max(0,x) | divround(a,b) muldiv(a,b,c)=round_half_up(a*b/c) pct(amount, rate_milli)=round_half_up(amount*rate_milli/100000) | if(c,a,b) gt ge lt le eq ne and or not (booleans are 1/0).",
  "Everything is an integer; no floats anywhere. Rates arrive as integers in thousandths of a percent (e.g. 9% -> 9000) from the document loader, never hard-coded here.",
  "Line amounts must not be negative. Rounding policy (B1): if debit!=credit by at most round_tolerance rial, the difference is added to the largest line of the deficient side; more than that is a rule error.",
  "Loaders (posting.php pb_posting_loaders) turn a document into {date, description, fields:{..}, dims:{key: tafsili_id|cost_center_id}}.",
  "T16.3 fields: purchase{goods,discount,labor,transport,broker_us,vat_rate_milli,paid_cash,paid_bank,cheque_out}; sale{goods,discount,vat_rate_milli,cogs_raw,cogs_proc,broker_us,labor,transport,recv_cash,recv_bank,cheque_in}; sreturn{goods,vat_rate_milli,has_tax,tax_amount,inv_raw,inv_proc,refund_cash,refund_cheque}; preturn{goods,vat_rate_milli,has_tax,tax_amount,refund_cash,refund_cheque}. VAT base = goods - discount.",
  "line.account_dim: key of ctx.dims holding an ACCOUNT id (T16.4 expenses use the chosen expense account); falls back to the role when the dim is 0/missing.",
  "T16.4 fields: cheque_ev{amt,bank_charge,dir_recv,dir_iss,f_<from>,t_<to> flags (in_hand,deposited,pending,cleared,bounced,endorsed,returned,cancelled); dims party,endorsee,treasury}; inst_pay|inst_recv{amt,cash_amt,bank_amt}; loan{amt,k_given,k_taken,k_repay_in,k_repay_out}; expense{amt,pay_cash,pay_bank,pay_credit; dims exp_account,cc,party,treasury}; bpay{amt}; owner_draw{draw_cash,draw_bank,contrib_cash,contrib_bank}. Payments saved WITH purchase/sale docs are posted ONLY by the doc voucher (T16.3); cheque_ev/inst_* never repost them.",
  "T16.5a fields: sep{in_raw,in_proc,labor,transport,abnormal} (output inventory = in_raw+in_proc+labor+transport-abnormal, EXACT identity of B9/A8; normal waste absorbed, abnormal expensed to waste_loss); proc_send{in_raw,in_proc} (paid order: our lots go to the processor -> inventory_at_processor); proc_recv{in_raw,in_proc,fee} (paid order received: outputs = input cost + fee, fee payable to processor tafsili party; at_processor cleared by the same inputs); proc_toll{charge} (received/toll order: service revenue = fee + waste charge, goods are off-balance, no inventory). Voucher dates: sep=sep_date, proc_send=order_date, proc_recv/proc_toll=receive_date.",
  "T16.5c fields (contracts for modules not built yet; no loaders registered): fx_settle_recv|fx_settle_pay{carry=booked base amount of the settled receivable/payable, cash, bank=base amount actually moved; dims party; diff=paid-carry => fx_diff 5207 debit (loss) or credit (gain)}; fx_reval{ar_up,ar_down,ap_up,ap_down = base-currency revaluation deltas of monetary items at period-end rate; optional, B10; gain/loss go to fx_unrealized 5209 (unrealized), NOT fx_diff 5207 (realized)}; count_adj{short_raw,short_proc,over_raw,over_proc = lot cost value of count shortages/overages; Dr count_diff 5103 / Cr inventory (S19.T19.1 hook)}.",
  "each (fx-reval step 3, optional on a line): {\"each\":\"groups\", account, debit/credit/when: exprs over the GROUP's fields, tafsili: <key in the group's dims>} => one line per member of loader ctx.groups = [{fields:{..}, dims:{..}, desc?}] (zero amounts dropped; missing/empty groups => no lines, no error). The group's dims[tafsili] becomes a direct tafsili_id on the line. Rule-level when still uses global fields. Lines without each behave exactly as before.",
  "T17.1c: sale/purchase use stored document tax when fields has_tax=1 (tax_amount = total_tax, integer rial; exempt/zero/mixed/discount/surcharge computed by tax.php at save); otherwise legacy pct(base, vat_rate_milli)."
 ],
